&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;28&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Development Operations to lead event execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;, including&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;logistics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;, messaging, and follow-up&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;28&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Partner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;with communications, policy, and data teams to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;ensure clear,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;consistent&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and compelling donor messaging&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Experience&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring 7+ years of fundraising experience with a demonstrated track record securing five- and six-figure gifts from individuals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience managing a donor portfolio and successfully closing major gifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in mission-driven or political fundraising environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with donor acquisition strategies such as direct mail or digital campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring familiarity with charter schools, K–12 education, education reform, and/or policy or advocacy organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Skills and Approach&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are confident and comfortable making direct and timely asks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a compelling communicator who turns ideas and impact into donor communications that inspire giving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a strong relationship builder who develops long-term donor partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a strategic thinker who identifies opportunities to increase donor engagement and giving levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced, remote environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly organized with disciplined pipeline and CRM management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring strong interpersonal and collaborative skills across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires approximately 10–20% travel for donor meetings and events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The National Alliance for Public Charter Schools offers a sector-leading salary and benefits package. We cover 100% of an employee’s medical, dental, and vision premiums, and 50% for spouses and dependents, including an HRA to cover 100% of in-network medical deductibles. We also offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;403(b) retirement account with up to a 6% match after 90 days of employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automatic life insurance coverage, short- and long-term disability coverage, and FSA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12 weeks of fully paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 PTO days annually, plus every federal holiday and a week off at year-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly reimbursement for internet and cellular service, plus a $500 home office setup stipend in your first 90 days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The anticipated starting salary range for this role is &lt;strong&gt;$85,000-$110,000,&lt;/strong&gt; commensurate with experience and qualifications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The National Alliance for Public Charter Schools believes that all families deserve high-quality public school options. Charter schools are independent public schools providing families with a new set of public school options. Each of these schools is developed to be a partnership between parents, teachers, and students.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When given the option, parents are choosing to enroll their children in charter schools. In fact, the demand for charter schools is far outpacing the supply in most communities. What began as a small movement in a few states has grown to become a major force in education reform across the country. Through advocacy, research, and strategic communications, the National Alliance works to grow the number of high-quality charter schools available to all families, especially those who do not have access to high-quality public schools.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

lsvp-daybreak-health:greenhouse:49702680.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hey Future Daybreak Clinicians!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Daybreak Health&lt;/span&gt;, we’re building a world where every young person has access to the mental health support they need to thrive. As a clinician on our team, you’ll be part of a &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;dedicated, compassionate community&lt;/span&gt; of therapists who are passionate about making a real impact. We value &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;flexibility, efficiency, and collaboration&lt;/span&gt;, allowing you to focus on what matters most—helping students. If you’re looking for &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;meaningful work, a supportive team, and the opportunity to grow&lt;/span&gt;, we’d love to have you join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role: Bilingual Remote Mental Health Therapist (Georgia Licensed Therapist)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;We are looking for&lt;/span&gt; Spanish-speaking mental health clinicians&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt; to provide &lt;/span&gt;teletherapy services&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt; to students across &lt;strong&gt;Georgia&lt;/strong&gt;. As a &lt;/span&gt;Remote Mental Health Therapist&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;, you will play a key role in &lt;/span&gt;delivering high-quality care&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt; while collaborating with &lt;/span&gt;schools, caregivers, and community partners&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt; to ensure student success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;We are currently working with the following license types: LPC, LCSW, LMFT.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;evidence-based teletherapy&lt;/span&gt; to students within our school district partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;trusted relationships&lt;/span&gt; with students and their families.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;school counselors and other providers&lt;/span&gt; to support student mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;psychoeducation&lt;/span&gt; and guidance to parents/caregivers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in&amp;nbsp;case consultations, team discussions, and ongoing training&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development and refinement of Daybreak Health’s clinical programs&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Receive competitive pay&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;($50-75/hour)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt; for direct care with guaranteed compensation for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;cancellations and no-shows&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Work remotely&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt; with &lt;/span&gt;flexible scheduling&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Join a supportive team with ongoing professional development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Be part of a mission-driven organization making a difference in students’ lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Our Therapists Are Saying...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&quot;As we learn, we’re teaching each other. A lot of the interventions that I’ve used are things that I’ve learned from other clinicians. I really love the clinical collaboration which ensures that we provide the best supports for our young clients.&quot;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&quot;I feel so honored and privileged to work with this group of clinicians. You make me better everyday.”&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&quot;I absolutely love working with my young clients. They are so real, honest, and....hilarious! They’re the ones inspiring me!”&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Employment Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Daybreak Health&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;, we embrace &lt;/span&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt; and are committed to &lt;/span&gt;equity and opportunity for all&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;. We encourage individuals from &lt;/span&gt;all backgrounds&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt; to apply, including those from diverse communities such as &lt;/span&gt;race, ethnicity, gender identity, sexual orientation, ability, age, religion, and socioeconomic background&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$55&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$85 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

lsvp-pacific-fusion:greenhouse:411413400.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Pacific Fusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pacific Fusion was founded in 2023 with the mission to power the world with abundant, affordable, clean energy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are rapidly designing and building a pulser-driven inertial fusion system to achieve net facility gain (more fusion energy output than stored energy input). In parallel, we are developing the key components required to build affordable fusion systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our plans are ambitious. We have raised over $900M so far from incredible investors, resourcing us to deliver on these plans. We are bringing together the best scientists, engineers, and operators from the fusion community, hard tech industry, and other sectors. We are united by a shared sense of urgency to provide clean power for the world, particularly managing climate change while meeting growing global energy demand. You can read more about us in&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://pacificfusion.com/updates/founders-letter&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;this letter from our founders&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pacific Fusion is seeking multiple Senior Mechanical Design Specialist&#39;s to support the development of advanced mechanical systems for next-generation fusion energy technology. This role is ideal for creative, hands-on mechanical designers with strong CAD expertise who can work independently while collaborating closely with scientists, engineers, and cross-functional technical teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Successful candidates will develop and analyze complex mechanical systems, conduct research to resolve challenging engineering problems, and translate concepts into fully detailed, production-ready designs. Depending on experience and qualifications, candidates may also provide technical leadership, including planning and leading multiple complex projects&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently analyze complex design problems and develop robust mechanical design solutions that satisfy all requirements and constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate design solutions into detailed layouts and assemblies using Creo Parametric&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop supporting documentation for design solutions, including analysis, schedules, cost estimates, and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture design intent using Creo Parametric, including model-based definition practices where applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate design documentation and configuration control within Windchill or equivalent PLM/ELM systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Estimate schedules and costs to determine effective approaches for design, materials selection, and fabrication to meet project deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and present technical material for design reviews, procedures, and related documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical mentorship to fellow designers and contribute to workforce planning, task prioritization, and work assignments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in formal design reviews and engineering change processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Author, review, and approve engineering reports, manuals, and other technical documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present designs and technical analyses to engineering leadership and project stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Associate&#39;s degree in Mechanical Design, Mechanical Mechanical Design&amp;nbsp;Technology, or a related technical field, or an equivalent combination of education and relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant applied experience with Creo Parametric and Windchill (or equivalent CAD/PLM systems).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge of CAD/PLM systems and configuration management best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of drafting standards, including ASME Y14.5 Geometric Dimensioning and Tolerancing (GD&amp;amp;T).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to analyze and interpret complex design requirements and develop original, practical engineering solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with hardware design, fabrication, assembly techniques, material selection, testing processes, and manufacturing methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read, interpret, and follow complex engineering drawings, specifications, sketches, and procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple tasks with attention to detail, accuracy, and independent follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to present technical information clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated technical or project leadership experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing staffing plans, safety notes, mentoring engineers or designers, and contributing to performance development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with project management methods and tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using CAD-supported Finite Element Analysis (FEA) to support conceptual and detailed design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range: &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$138,100&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$207,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits for Eligible Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Industry-competitive salary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Equity plan&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;6% employer 401k matching&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Generous paid time off (including sick leave, vacation, paid family leave)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Medical, Dental, and Vision insurance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Actual base salary offered will be determined by: experience, skills, and work location. This range is for base salary, our total compensation includes equity and benefits. We welcome you to apply even if your expectations are outside our listed range. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pacific Fusion is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pacific Fusion is committed to providing reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals with disabilities in our job application procedures and throughout employment. If you need assistance or any accommodation, please let us know. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Pacific Fusion does not accept unsolicited resumes from recruiters or employment agencies without a fully executed recruitment agreement in place. In the absence of such agreement, Pacific Fusion reserves the right to pursue and hire any candidates without an obligation to pay fees. Agencies are requested not to contact Pacific Fusion hiring managers or employees regarding recruiting services.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

