&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active Current Certified Home Health Aide license in good standing with the NJ Board of Nursing. BAYADA hosts&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;CHHA certification classes&lt;/strong&gt; offered monthly! &lt;strong&gt;Not certified? Ask about our affordable certification training program.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At BAYADA, you have the flexibility&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;to CHOOSE: where you want to work, who you want to work with, and the hours you want to work!&amp;nbsp;BAYADA Home Health Care has an&lt;strong&gt; immediate need&lt;/strong&gt; for home health aides in &lt;strong&gt;Ocean County, NJ&lt;/strong&gt; in the following towns and beyond: Toms River, Whiting, Manchester, Brick, Lakewood, Forked River, Barnegat, Tuckerton, Manahawkin, LBI, Jackson.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Rates: $20 and up per hour&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;depending on experience and the case requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HHA Job Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform personal care: bathing, grooming, toileting, feeding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with ambulation / transfers / mechanical lift devices / range of motion exercises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with Home Management: laundry, meal preparation, bed making, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly Pay, Sick Time, PTO, Scholarship Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Referral Bonus Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible scheduling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 clinical nursing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health benefits available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Qs5ZcUwwhOI&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have questions? Click the &lt;strong&gt;APPLY NOW&lt;/strong&gt; button and a BAYADA representative will reach out to you immediately!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: black;&quot;&gt;As an accredited, regulated, certified, and licensed home health care provider, BAYADA complies with all state/local mandates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA is celebrating 50 years of compassion, excellence, and reliability. Learn more about our 50th anniversary celebration and how you can join in &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bayada.com/50&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
