&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is looking for a compassionate and dedicated Licensed Practical Nurse (LPN) to join our team in our Davidson County Visits office. This position services our geriatric clients&amp;nbsp;on a&amp;nbsp;per visit basis in homes throughout Chatham and Lee counties in North Carolina.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
